<title>UK: UK's WS Atkins wins new contracts.</title>
<headline>UK's WS Atkins wins new contracts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction and technolgoy consultancy WS Atkins Plc said on Friday that it has won new contracts worth between 40 to 50 million pounds over five years.</p>
<p>It has been awarded the maintainance management of over 1,600 kilometres of motorways and trunk roads from the UK Department of Environment, Transport and Regions.</p>
<p>Atkins announced on Thursday that it had regained a property services contract with Oxfordshire County Council.</p>
